     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>Our repertoire includes two new activities: clone and synchronize. The first one is a kind of parallel branch: it clones the arrival and processes each copy in parallel through user-defined sub-trajectories. Then, you can synchronize them, i.e., merge all those threads again into a single one. </div><div><br></div><div>See <a href=\"https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/71&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467965807000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3714PawOPbOMXBAxsMlWS2\">#71</a> for more details. The <a href=\"https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/blob/master/vignettes/C-trajectories.Rmd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/blob/master/vignettes/C-trajectories.Rmd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467965807000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3iWfuUjRoR2ymp-ClofB8M\">&quot;Advanced Trajectory Usage&quot;</a> vignette has been updated with this and other examples. And as always, check out the master branch if you wish to test it.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">Iñaki Úcar<br><a href=\"http://www.enchufa2.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.enchufa2.es&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467965807000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-anZ8Nt4E-SvrqHNwISYV\">http://www.enchufa2.es</a><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/#%21/Enchufa2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/%23%2521/Enchufa2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467965807000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0peFQuBmSrouXYxj2w8pqH\">@Enchufa2</a><br></div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n"
